    tier: T2
    action: modified
    distills: "UC-4's 'one rule knowingly unmet' paragraph named a debt owed to the epic close; it now names the three conditions DEC-34 sets and cites the record, and states precisely which route reaches the full value (the path on the row title, both host and path in the detail pane's URI). Provenance bumped to v5, recording that all three native surfaces were re-designed and rebuilt by E-REDESIGN. No observable contract moves - this WU adds no capability, and the doc says what is true after it rather than what is promised."
  - path: docs/work/2026-09-06-redesign-w11-plan.html
