    distills: "The WU plan, written before the code: the requirement, what leaves the tree and what already left (W2 deleted the legacy kit, so W11 inherits a smaller row than the epic plan wrote), the check-9 accounting, the expected result and a per-level test plan with no waiver. Its unit prediction (731 tests) proved wrong at 741 and is corrected in the test/v2 note and the result report rather than edited away."
